    "turn_text": "Yes, thank you so much. Yeah, the Congresswoman is taking time out of a really crazy schedule the last few days. As most of her listeners know, this week has been candidate filing week and also a bunch of other stuff going on in the news and on the legislative floors in Congress and in the state Capitol. So first, Congresswoman, just a real quick thing on where your district is,",
