        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that public recognition of legislative progress should be acknowledged promptly and directly.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Legislative success on issues like sex trafficking is worth highlighting due to its moral urgency.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views collaboration across levels of government (federal and state) as relevant and credible evidence of legitimacy.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience member is expected to provide a clear explanation of the bill’s provisions and its path to passage.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The inclusion of multiple political figures (including those from different parties) strengthens the perceived credibility of the issue.",
