  {
    "episode_id": 86581,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86581.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "So in the criminal component, I mean, right now, take it from what you're saying, there's virtually no, I mean, they're not necessarily breaking any laws by their advertising. Is that part of the problem?",
