    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 86581,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86581.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's a tough climate. I will say that. And we are the only targeted congressional seat in the state. Missouri's second congressional district is more of a swing district, given the fact that it takes in the suburban area of St. Louis County and some of the excerpts. I believe when I filed, there were maybe four or five Democrats that have now filed for office,",
