  {
    "episode_id": 86581,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86581.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 33,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think we're very polarized. I think we've seen that after the last presidential election. The left is energized. The right is energized. It'll be interesting to see, especially in an off presidential election cycle year, what the turnout is. I imagine that it will be stronger than it was in, let's say, 2016. So we're ready for that. And we're going to work and earn every vote there is in this district.",
