    "turn_text": "this is, as I've said, a tough climate and you've got to work and earn every vote in the state of Missouri. This is the show me state and Claire McCaskill is formidable. Absolutely. And she's raising a lot of money. So you've got to get out. You've got to have a good ground game. I think the key I'm an old grassroots girl. I used to be a township committeewoman before I was anything else at the most local, neighbor-to-neighbor level and you've got to work it. You've got to have a good field staff and get out there in every community across this state and tell what your vision is and your plan for the future and how you can make a difference in their lives and that of their families and you've got to work hard and earn it.",
