    "turn_text": "Well, I've said from the very beginning that the allegations against the governor are very serious. I think the indictment is most disturbing and serious. I've asked for a full and swift investigation and that is ongoing at this time. I do believe the governor is like any citizen in the state of Missouri or beyond. should be allowed his due process and his day in court. However, I will say that I do believe that elected officials and those that serve with the public trust should be held to a higher standard. So I have full faith in our Missouri General Assembly and speaker Richardson who has also instigated an investigation. I think those investigations should go forward and in a non-political and a forthright and swift manner so that this issue can be laid to rest.",
